    {
      "target": "동생이 오늘 초등학교에 입학했어요.",
      "reading": "Dongsaengi oneul chodeunghakgyoe iphakhaesseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "My younger sibling entered elementary school today.",
        "ko": "동생이 오늘 초등학교에 입학했어요.",
        "ipa": "Dongsaengi oneul chodeunghakgyoe iphakhaesseoyo.",
        "ar": "التحق أخي الصغير بالمدرسة الابتدائية اليوم.",
        "cs": "Můj mladší sourozenec nastoupil dnes do základní školy.",
        "da": "Min lillebror begyndte i folkeskolen i dag.",
        "de": "Mein jüngerer Bruder ist heute in die Grundschule gekommen.",
